      "title": "A FIELD PACK",
      "text": "The second team's, left in a locker as if its owner meant to come back for it. A camera with no film. A map of the valley with the castle ringed twice. A note in pencil: Hale says we go in by the railway. Nobody comes out by the road."
    },
    {
      "x": 21,
      "y": 31,
      "dx": 0,
      "dy": -1,
      "title": "A MANIFEST",
      "text": "Night convoy 41. Twelve crates, marked: fragile, keep cold, do not open. For the works, lower gate. Escort of six. The quartermaster adds: double the escort. The drivers of convoy 39 never came back, and their truck came in by itself, in the right gear, with its lamps off."
    }
